{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "b61580af440f56ec58f4a0fd8c3403c2ba51a7c609511d5ff6ecbd1f4df5dd8f", "ja": "たとえば……お仕事をポイント制にするとか。\n備品の補充で5ポイント、衣装製作で100ポイント！", "zh": "比如……把工作改成积分制之类的。\n补充备品可以获得5分，制作服装可以获得100分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "f694ae10730d7b571a398129ab8569266afc2d171b963577601e627a7df353f4", "ja": "ポイントが貯まったら、お菓子と交換……なんて♪\n今度、音無先輩に相談してみようかな？", "zh": "积分攒够了就能兑换点心……之类的♪  \n下次要不要找音无前辈商量一下呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d35659642345f6141fc4799103de3ac3c992dda7b7023a19c5948a81bad1c859", "ja": "お疲れ様です、青羽さん。\nポイントがどうとか聞こえましたけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n我好像听到你在说什么积分之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "ddcfa374de09d8a7b443ff20737df3d83eb58bebf8c9258886289fa1d8a20e28", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。お疲れ様です！\n私のお仕事をポイント制にしたらって考えてたんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。辛苦了！\n我刚才在想，要是把我的工作改成积分制的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "f1c0a0e132029077060ac3495ab8cdfb3ffcf6f8076937b1d59e05cf0fe3162e", "ja": "普段のお仕事に遊び心を加えたら、\n毎日がもっと楽しくなるんじゃないかな～って。", "zh": "如果在日常工作里加入一点趣味的话，\n每天会不会变得更有意思呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b5690b78e1b3ad331f8db3934c45d607b67b2921840e743c0feef0b88dc20d94", "ja": "なるほど、そうですね。期日内に経費精算したら\nポイントがもらえるとかなら、俺も少しは……。", "zh": "原来如此，确实是这样。要是能在期限内完成报销手续就拿到积分之类的，我也会稍微……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "b827493be08085d32ae648836cae5d5ffb4097c66f9d6dfe73563518026050cb", "ja": "ダメですよ、{$P$}さん！\n大事な書類は、ポイントがなくても提出しなきゃ。", "zh": "不行啊，{$P$}先生！\n重要的文件就算没有积分，也必须提交。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2f162d1ff3e20b7f5e54a51a51a496796067a3ffa4c03658a4b80ef192d349a8", "ja": "うっ……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "63a276acd0ff86d06d9c939c3dde5b6e6002abb03629d1c8caa0d5f4b9c238d8", "ja": "音無先輩も困ってて……あ、そうでした！\n事務所にすぐ来てほしいって、伝言がありました！", "zh": "音无前辈也很为难……啊，对了！有留言说希望你马上来事务所！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8dd83f96a5857b97d539774d47665563ce920fc4cef43b6b617af630c5db3714", "ja": "えっ、早速ですか？　なにか提出し忘れてたっけ……\nとにかく、行ってきます！", "zh": "诶，这么快就要去吗？我是不是忘了提交什么……\n总之，我先过去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "c8b2573254fca69d4758f138d9aeb22439d67f21bd853f1c1f40f9819c370b8c", "ja": "はい！　行ってらっしゃ～い♪\nよーし、私もポイントがなくても、頑張るぞ～！", "zh": "好的！路上小心～♪\n\n好——我就算没有点数，也要加油～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6a403d7fd6a45d7064bdace06084b56657f67d51626ee49c20329c4f931e52ab", "ja": "お疲れさまです、社長、音無さん。\nすみません、何か急ぎの要件があるとか……？", "zh": "辛苦了，社长、音无小姐。\n抱歉，听说您有急事找我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "a76324c481a028c55a353ee9bdfcdedc5e0794d03e19112a897872bed3e173d8", "ja": "おお、待っていたよ！　いや、実はそう急ぎでも\nないんだが……大事な話だから、早く伝えたくてね！", "zh": "哦，我一直在等你！其实也没那么着急……\n但这是很重要的事，所以想早点告诉你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3cf7b6ed4006ff637c70b8d41a26504affc6b60b2ed195860859aa68575b6011", "ja": "おお、そうでしたか。よかった……。\nてっきり、何か提出し忘れていたのかと。", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊。太好了……\n我还以为是不小心忘了提交什么呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "bf24aec0d2ef63877ffd814abfb7e195a4c915c7c368bb8e86f2ee75ce46fe0a", "ja": "そっちもです！　先週末の交通費、\n早く提出してくださいね♪", "zh": "您那边也是！上周末的交通费，请尽快提交哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f139968ac696f21fe2f7e1754ed184ff7dc4ae421db966fa4833a86307789cff", "ja": "うっ！　す、すみません……。", "zh": "呜！对、对不起……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "e168917d5611bf2e8a598c50a56783c98cbd3b8dddecd94ece76aada5abf2171", "ja": "はっはっは、それはそれでしっかり頼むよ！\nところで、私の話というのは……他でもない。", "zh": "哈哈哈，那就拜托你好好处理了！\n话说回来，我要说的事嘛……不是别的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "eaf77bd4099de65c79c79802e989fe1742f02c5ac74fdcd3587d407d47d9399d", "ja": "この765プロの将来に関わる話、\nといったところかな。", "zh": "算是关系到这家765事务所未来的话题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "822b62f7c2218293949696c7aae4c0cb424ef0f449cd5d069d8d98265e7a2f84", "ja": "765プロの、将来……。", "zh": "765艺能的，将来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "1ba1918c2e68231f8a5f3f522fc452a0d855a9a383c9d6ff40f175cbce9c7681", "ja": "うむ。群雄割拠のアイドル業界を生き残るためには、\n我が765プロも進化しなくてはならない。", "zh": "嗯。为了在群雄割据的偶像业界生存下去，\n我们765事务所也必须不断进化。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "1f4ab64ad01257bc1d45ca12aedfb038c4099e4b562099d0a5752578c3b625bb", "ja": "そこで、765PRO ALLSTARSの新たな挑戦として\n今までにない公演を開催したい、と考えている！", "zh": "因此，作为765PRO ALLSTARS全新的挑战，想要举办一场前所未有的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "2bba0c05f8294758e52d013d58df57fc0ea4890f743808f5f6e8e7adcbcc5fa4", "ja": "今までにない公演……！\nその言葉だけで、ワクワクしてきますね！", "zh": "前所未有的公演……！\n光是听到这句话，就让人兴奋起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "4dd6eb119cc031f2a9575cb142ba49655bbaa0cffe6d654a25dd2723c43d5a37", "ja": "ふっふっふ、そうだろう？\n私もまったく、同じ気持ちだよ！", "zh": "呵呵呵，没错吧？  \n我也是完全一样的心情哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "fb00d8619eab0292ab34d422884e4eddef925c3548d83f228fe7f98139bdc109", "ja": "それで、その新たな挑戦とは……？", "zh": "那么，这个全新的挑战是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "a3bec9eb6006d9fef241294f56d58b8feb00852ffb4e7157a8f1e20c18a0702f", "ja": "それを君に考えてもらいたい！", "zh": "我想让你来考虑这件事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "415f2ca48e10ea4c148a73238a287491f3301b09caa17b0d98c40d6101ea7218", "ja": "そうなんです。社長ったら「今こそ刺激が必要だ！」\nって突然言い出したんですけど、それっきりで……。", "zh": "就是这样。社长突然说：“现在正需要刺激！”之后，就没下文了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "bae43f1aeed7b333e56b25db4f6f68c635d996e2901856969a57bfd4b320323a", "ja": "結局、{$P$}さんに\n助けを求めることにしたんですよね？", "zh": "结果还是决定向{$P$}先生求助了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "76497a1d1e148242fadebf52cf7ff7d2167d2069c9f2e872d421840d84e240dd", "ja": "ま、まあ、そうなんだがね……。\nだが事務所の進化には、君の成長こそが必要なのだよ！", "zh": "嗯，嗯，确实是这样……  \n但是，事务所的进化，正需要你的成长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "91dff0110cd63674a8c29fbd3f12228330928c6bd1ff0adadb1eabaaf331705b", "ja": "どうかね？　765プロの新しいチャレンジを\nここはひとつ、君に託したい！　と思ってるんだが……", "zh": "怎么样？我想把765Pro的新挑战交给你来负责！……我是这么想的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_1031", "source_sha256": "62a3e713f13c252452c90a0003af6e8df6b7db6b60f36a41f4d1260909358f2e", "ja": "わかりました", "zh": "我知道了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "502b6c021d0f30d120d04280d663dc3bf3e0d9b86776ad6f641900186848b68b", "ja": "わかりました。ぜひ、やらせてください！\nアイドル達と共に成長した姿をお見せします！", "zh": "我明白了。请务必让我来做！\n一定会让您看到我和偶像们一同成长的姿态！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "27563f6e8cf793c11c3ffae1a8d6be059774469478ff01f94cfd735cdc9328fc", "ja": "おお、よく言ってくれた！　その熱意とやる気を糧に、\nどんな挑戦に立ち向かうのか、楽しみにしているよ！", "zh": "哦，说得好！我很期待你将以那份热情和干劲为动力，迎接怎样的挑战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "c6270ec8d8f3a878e4e4cef36653dbec3f4d3417dcd4987546b9885972c3d8f5", "ja": "もう、{$P$}さんったら、\n社長に甘いんだから。", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先生也太由着社长了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "1b02a7d305d980205b3ffc53f4ae6e587fe4898bfcb4f6d20abf55c9d1e34de8", "ja": "（でも、それこそが二人の絆の証なのかも……。\nああっ、久しぶりに……ダメ、ダメよ小鳥～！）", "zh": "（不过，或许这正是两人羁绊的证明……\n啊！好久没这样了……不行，不行啊，小鸟～！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "544a5f142a5115bc65ffa1aefc5d552a8f0942ac9b73410b4e5bc91f45bad013", "ja": "（新たな挑戦か……。難しい課題だけど、やりがいが\nある。早速、劇場に戻って企画を考えよう！）", "zh": "（新的挑战吗……虽然是个艰难的课题，但很值得去做。马上回剧场考虑企划吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
